    "title": "Gallery",
    "description": "<b>Gallery</b> show photo, video, slideshow, is perfect 3D effect .\r\n\r\nIt is a smart app focused on photo management, helping to protect private photos\r\n\r\nManage photos after editing & hide them with gallery vault\r\n\r\nThis <b>Gallery</b> app is an easy-to-use offline gallery to help you organize and manage photos and videos. With the help of the full-featured gallery, you can edit photos, use password to protect/hide photos, clear similar photos.\r\n\r\n<b>Gallery</b> is fast, lightweight and the home for all your photos and videos, automatically organized your photo, videos, album, GIF and easy to share. <b>Gallery</b> is designed as a smart all in one for private gallery, Gallery Vault, photo view, photo edit app for managing your photo and video albums. Password-protect your photos, organize them!\r\nThis smart gallery is your new essential picture app, Gallery Album is the application for image & video viewing that works for Android device users.\r\n\r\nGallery app is simple, modern, light and fast  gallery and picture manager app for viewing and organizing your photos and videos. \r\n\r\n<b>Gallery Vault Key Features:</b>\r\n\u26a1Private Photo Vault: Keep your images and videos secure in your private vault;\r\n\u26a1Gallery Vault: Safeguard your cherished memories with pin code lock protection;\r\n\u26a1Photo Organizer: Sort and organize by date, time, events, and location;\r\n\u26a1Locked Photo Album Editor: Enhance and edit with filters, cropping, and more;\r\n\u26a1Gallery Lock: Secure your images;\r\n\r\n<b>Photo and Video Editor</b>\r\nGallery allows you to crop, rotate, resize pictures, apply filters/blur and compress videos. It can help you easily edit photos and videos.\r\n\r\n<b>Quickly Find Your Favorite Moments</b>\r\nDifficult to find the photo you need in a bunch of photos? Gallery supports to sort by multiple types, filter and search photos, which helps you quickly find the specific one you want.\r\n\r\n<b>Private Photo Vault & Video Locker</b>\r\nProtect private videos and photos via PIN code. It's the safest place for sensitive files. Now you can share your phone without worrying about any privacy problems.\r\n\r\n<b>Gallery Lock - Hide Pictures And Videos</b>\r\nGallery can easily hide and encrypt your photos and videos to keep secret to the secure Vault, keep your privacy absolutely safe. \r\nThe hidden photos and videos won't be visible in the system gallery and all other apps. Only you can see the photos by entering the password. And grouped hidden photos and videos by folder whatever you want!\r\n\r\n<b>Photo Organizer - Organize with Ease!</b>\r\nPrivate Photo Vault acts as your photo organizer extraordinaire. Sort and arrange by date, time, events, location, and more. Finding that particular picture has never been easier.\r\n\r\n<b>Filters and adjust</b>\r\nGallery is designed with different editing tools to make your editing look professional. Add artsy filters like light room, vignette, vintage, glitch effects, blur effects, Hue, and more.\r\n\r\n<b>Built-in HD Video Player</b>\r\nGallery supports video player functionality to play videos for the perfect video-watching experience. You can watch and share videos directly with the easy-to-use gallery app.\r\n\r\n<b>More Features:</b>\r\n- A beautiful and simple user interface. Colorful themes and modern design, transparent layered and immersive user interface.\r\n- Search photos or videos by date, location. Your photos are now searchable by when and where you take them.\r\n\r\n<b>Gallery</b> is an excellent, full featured gallery and photo editor. It's a great galleria, photography galleries, format galleries, collection Gallery, quick photo, videos, gif & photo album app for your mobile.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Gallery</b> show photo, video, slideshow, is perfect 3D effect .<br><br>It is a smart app focused on photo management, helping to protect private photos<br><br>Manage photos after editing &amp; hide them with gallery vault<br><br>This <b>Gallery</b> app is an easy-to-use offline gallery to help you organize and manage photos and videos. With the help of the full-featured gallery, you can edit photos, use password to protect/hide photos, clear similar photos.<br><br><b>Gallery</b> is fast, lightweight and the home for all your photos and videos, automatically organized your photo, videos, album, GIF and easy to share. <b>Gallery</b> is designed as a smart all in one for private gallery, Gallery Vault, photo view, photo edit app for managing your photo and video albums. Password-protect your photos, organize them!<br>This smart gallery is your new essential picture app, Gallery Album is the application for image &amp; video viewing that works for Android device users.<br><br>Gallery app is simple, modern, light and fast  gallery and picture manager app for viewing and organizing your photos and videos. <br><br><b>Gallery Vault Key Features:</b><br>\u26a1Private Photo Vault: Keep your images and videos secure in your private vault;<br>\u26a1Gallery Vault: Safeguard your cherished memories with pin code lock protection;<br>\u26a1Photo Organizer: Sort and organize by date, time, events, and location;<br>\u26a1Locked Photo Album Editor: Enhance and edit with filters, cropping, and more;<br>\u26a1Gallery Lock: Secure your images;<br><br><b>Photo and Video Editor</b><br>Gallery allows you to crop, rotate, resize pictures, apply filters/blur and compress videos. It can help you easily edit photos and videos.<br><br><b>Quickly Find Your Favorite Moments</b><br>Difficult to find the photo you need in a bunch of photos? Gallery supports to sort by multiple types, filter and search photos, which helps you quickly find the specific one you want.<br><br>